          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "unordered-list",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "highlight_category_action_item",
            "highlight_notes_list": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Pain Point",
              "object": "text"
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "header-2",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "highlight_category_pain_point",
            "highlight_notes_title": true,
            "machine_title": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "It becomes tough to demonstrate the importance of analytics remotely without a ready product, especially when the target audience may not have a strong focus on data in their job roles.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "ceec03aa-6561-436f-bf99-69bffe348024",
                    "time": 225.79454,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "machine_note": true,
                    "model": "machine_note_cleaned"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The challenge in their business model is the need for any progress to be independent of the LIS.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "ef6519ec-aead-4979-b8e2-17e3f14f04ba",
                    "time": 552.49005,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "machine_note": true,
                    "model": "machine_note_cleaned"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The lack of user interface and actionable features for key account management levels is hindering the utilization of the platform by certain big regions.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "8922657a-9cb3-49a9-9b87-2047e6c4ed3d",
                    "time": 1193.15,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "machine_note": true,
                    "model": "machine_note_cleaned"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Some clients, like Redcliff and Agilis, do not have any UI or actionable items on their end, leading to a lack of focus on understanding reports or taking necessary next steps.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "3d8c9276-4c27-40e5-80c0-7755fa3956fe",
                    "time": 1216.4401,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "machine_note": true,
                    "model": "machine_note_cleaned"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The current system is limited to LIS reporting data and CRM, and does not engage with doctors or Rx, hindering potential opportunities for integration with EHR systems.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "b61bfb8b-6e60-45f5-892b-1bffcc3290bc",
                    "time": 1348.435,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "machine_note": true,
                    "model": "machine_note_cleaned"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Duplicates were not removed while calculating the revisits.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "2b7a8093-14f6-442f-abdf-1e07699bada2",
                    "time": 2825.53,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "machine_note": true,
                    "model": "machine_note_cleaned"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The historical data used is biased as it only includes individuals who are likely sick, resulting in higher CBC values.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "adf7015c-021b-4e9e-8cf8-db58b7f0cb4f",
                    "time": 3516.615,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "machine_note": true,
                    "model": "machine_note_cleaned"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Managing restrictions, particularly limiting messages to no more than 4, and the willingness to work within those constraints.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "e4d89a43-4710-4a22-98f6-43697bc56696",
                    "time": 3759.735,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "machine_note": true,
                    "model": "machine_note_cleaned"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            }
